WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:13.511
The Beijing AI Origin Community covers a provisional rough boundary of about 1.

00:00:13.511 --> 00:00:27.022
043 million square meters, derived from the announcement text extents.

00:00:27.022 --> 00:00:40.533
The proposal deliberately preserves the original street texture and the daily shops that anchor everyday life, and explicitly does not require any of these to be converted into innovation hosts; any change to the neighborhood fabric must pass through community announcement and resident consent before it can move forward.

00:00:40.533 --> 00:00:59.800
AI intervention is restricted to three specific types of public nodes: the neighborhood council hall, the community library, and pocket parks — places where the community already gathers rather than places where private innovation activity would normally concentrate. Withdrawal of all AI intervention returns the complete traditional community intact; the design does not assume that AI must stay in the neighborhood long-term, and when professional handoff fails for any reason the place simply returns to its G0 ordinary state as built.

